WEBVTT

00:11:29.121 --> 00:11:31.954
They lack a lot of the tools we normally
use to build cultures. Right.

00:11:31.996 --> 00:11:35.037
They can't they can't tell stories
the same way that humans do.

00:11:35.662 --> 00:11:38.329
Certainly language capabilities
are more limited.

00:11:38.912 --> 00:11:40.621
How do chimpanzees build cultures

00:11:42.204 --> 00:11:45.912
through observation, imitation
and practice?

00:11:46.121 --> 00:11:48.496
And that is one definition
of human culture.

00:11:48.496 --> 00:11:53.037
Behavior passed from one generation
to the next through observation

00:11:53.329 --> 00:11:56.579
and that it's demonstrated so clearly.

00:11:56.579 --> 00:12:00.496
You watch the development of
an infant, for example,